  "prefLabel": "Rev 2205.10 Function 4800: Intergovernmental Transfers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2205.10 Function 4800: Intergovernmental Transfers.\n\n(a) Account 4800, intergovernmental transfers, classification shall be for pass-through of funds to subrecipient organizations in support of activities financed by grant money.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2206.10); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
